  "Q00098_SagaOfTheShillienSaint/7-07.htm": {
   "file": "Q00098_SagaOfTheShillienSaint/7-07.htm",
   "quest": 98,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The tablet goes still and quiet, as if nothing had ever happened. Kamilen in Goddard Castle Town has the next Stone of Commune.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "when": [
    "cond 10; !((npcId == 31581) && st.isCompleted()); player.getClassId().getId() == getPrevClass(player)"
   ],
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00071_SagaOfEvasTemplar/7-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00071_SagaOfEvasTemplar/7-02.htm",
   "quest": 71,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: I feel his cold sense of abandonment and betrayal. Do my thought deceive me? The anger and sense of loss are overwhelming! Who would so cruelly block the way of pilgrims for centuries? Can I defeat him?",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00071_SagaOfEvasTemplar/7-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00071_SagaOfEvasTemplar/7-03.htm",
   "quest": 71,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The time has come to examine the Tablet of Vision. Panacea's attack continues!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00071_SagaOfEvasTemplar/7-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00071_SagaOfEvasTemplar/7-04.htm",
   "quest": 71,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: You sense a disturbance near the tablet. The time hasn't yet come for you to prove yourself.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00071_SagaOfEvasTemplar/7-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00071_SagaOfEvasTemplar/7-06.htm",
   "quest": 71,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Countless thoughts beyond comprehension sear painfully into your brain. You hear the faint whisper of a woman's voice. A vision appears of an indecisive Knight... He turned back because he was persuaded by Panacea. He looks unfamiliar but common. He is Master Sinden of Aden Castle…",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00075_SagaOfTheTitan/7-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00075_SagaOfTheTitan/7-02.htm",
   "quest": 75,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Behold! Before your very eyes! Muhark the Destroyer, the Fallen Noble Orc, the Genius Warrior of the Atuba tribe and the only disciple of Prefect Lakan.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00075_SagaOfTheTitan/7-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00075_SagaOfTheTitan/7-03.htm",
   "quest": 75,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The Tablet of Vision is inscribed with incomprehensible hieroglyphs. Mudaha's attack continues!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00075_SagaOfTheTitan/7-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00075_SagaOfTheTitan/7-04.htm",
   "quest": 75,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: You sense a disturbance near the tablet. The time hasn't yet come for you to prove yourself.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00075_SagaOfTheTitan/7-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00075_SagaOfTheTitan/7-06.htm",
   "quest": 75,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Countless thoughts beyond comprehension sear painfully into your brain. You hear the faint whisper of a woman's voice. A vision appears of a worried man, concerned about the coming winter. He awaits a qualified recruit, and is holding the Stone of Commune! Find Seer Skahi in Godda…",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00079_SagaOfTheAdventurer/7-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00079_SagaOfTheAdventurer/7-02.htm",
   "quest": 79,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: It's Ezekiel! I read about him in the book I got from Black Cat!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00079_SagaOfTheAdventurer/7-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00079_SagaOfTheAdventurer/7-03.htm",
   "quest": 79,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Ezekiel must be dealt with first.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00079_SagaOfTheAdventurer/7-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00079_SagaOfTheAdventurer/7-04.htm",
   "quest": 79,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Someone else is currently communing with the stone. Come back later.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00079_SagaOfTheAdventurer/7-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00079_SagaOfTheAdventurer/7-06.htm",
   "quest": 79,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: You feel a strange, disconnected force enter your body. The tablet seems to be communicating with you. You see a vision of a Human, standing before a house engulfed in a dark aura. It seems to located on the road from the Ketra Orc Outpost to Goddard Castle Town. You feel the Tabl…",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00085_SagaOfTheCardinal/7-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00085_SagaOfTheCardinal/7-02.htm",
   "quest": 85,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Suddenly, someone appears on the other side of the tablet. Could it be Haures, the main character in the book you got from Hollint?",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00085_SagaOfTheCardinal/7-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00085_SagaOfTheCardinal/7-03.htm",
   "quest": 85,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: She has the Stone of Commune and you must get it from her!",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00085_SagaOfTheCardinal/7-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00085_SagaOfTheCardinal/7-04.htm",
   "quest": 85,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: There's a disturbance far from here. This isn't the time to get involved.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00085_SagaOfTheCardinal/7-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00085_SagaOfTheCardinal/7-06.htm",
   "quest": 85,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Countless thoughts beyond comprehension sear painfully into your brain. Some secrets of the tablet begin to be revealed. Suddenly, the vision goes white... and emerging from within is a face... Could it be...? Bastian? And then, just as suddenly, the vision is gone.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00089_SagaOfTheMysticMuse/7-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00089_SagaOfTheMysticMuse/7-02.htm",
   "quest": 89,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Fallen Angel Allector? He must be the suspicious one that I felt before. I sense that he has the Stone of Commune.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00089_SagaOfTheMysticMuse/7-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00089_SagaOfTheMysticMuse/7-03.htm",
   "quest": 89,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The time has come to get the first Stone of Commune. Destroy Allector and take his stone.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00089_SagaOfTheMysticMuse/7-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00089_SagaOfTheMysticMuse/7-04.htm",
   "quest": 89,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Someone nearby must have the Stone of Commune! It's too noisy now. Try again later when things quiet down a bit.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00089_SagaOfTheMysticMuse/7-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00089_SagaOfTheMysticMuse/7-06.htm",
   "quest": 89,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Countless thoughts beyond comprehension sear painfully into your brain. A vision appears of a woman in blue. And suddenly, the location of the next Stone of Commune becomes clear! Magister Alminas of Goddard Castle Town has it.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00091_SagaOfTheArcanaLord/7-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00091_SagaOfTheArcanaLord/7-02.htm",
   "quest": 91,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: When putting your hands on the tablet, your entire body is knocked back by something powerful but invisible. Then, it begins to apprear.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00091_SagaOfTheArcanaLord/7-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00091_SagaOfTheArcanaLord/7-03.htm",
   "quest": 91,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: The Tablet of Vision cannot be accessed without the Stone of Commune. Defeat Shakiel and take it from him",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00091_SagaOfTheArcanaLord/7-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00091_SagaOfTheArcanaLord/7-04.htm",
   "quest": 91,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Someone else is currently communing with the Tablet of Vision. Come back later.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00091_SagaOfTheArcanaLord/7-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00091_SagaOfTheArcanaLord/7-06.htm",
   "quest": 91,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: When you hold the Stone of Commune in your hands and concentrate, the Tablet of Vision is slowly surrounded by bright light. Hundreds of voices begin pounding in your head... they seem to be reading some form of scripture, a scripture that reveals a great and horrible truth. Ah, t…",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00098_SagaOfTheShillienSaint/7-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00098_SagaOfTheShillienSaint/7-02.htm",
   "quest": 98,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Suddenly, someone appears on the other side of the tablet. Could it be Naverius, the main character in the book from Anastia?",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00098_SagaOfTheShillienSaint/7-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00098_SagaOfTheShillienSaint/7-03.htm",
   "quest": 98,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: I must take the Stone of Commune from Naverius if I am to commune with the Tablet of Vision.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00098_SagaOfTheShillienSaint/7-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00098_SagaOfTheShillienSaint/7-04.htm",
   "quest": 98,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: A vision appears of a fight, far away from here. This isn't the time to get involved.",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00098_SagaOfTheShillienSaint/7-06.htm": {
   "file": "Q00098_SagaOfTheShillienSaint/7-06.htm",
   "quest": 98,
   "text": "Tablet of Vision: Countless thoughts beyond comprehension sear painfully into your brain. The secrets of the tablet start to be revealed. Suddenly, the vision goes white... and emerging from within is a face... Could it be...? Kamilen? A strong feeling emerges that she has the Stone of Commune in G…",
   "header": "Tablet of Vision",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
